.55,"e":320.24,"line":81},{"w":"“First","s":320.24,"e":320.85,"line":82},{"w":"time?”","s":320.85,"e":321.46,"line":82}],"lines":[{"s":1.2,"e":3.83,"text":"GRAYS — LAST CALL AT THE HUB"},{"s":3.83,"e":8.54,"text":"Attention, travelers: all departures are arriving."},{"s":8.54,"e":11.08,"text":"Gate Zero has never opened."},{"s":11.08,"e":14.65,"text":"“Sit down. I already lived your life.”"},{"s":14.65,"e":18.7,"text":"Black glass bar where the black holes bend,"},{"s":18.7,"e":23.12,"text":"Gray in a clean-cut coat with a century's grin."},{"s":23.12,"e":27.17,"text":"No bodyguards, no crown, no celestial hype,"},{"s":27.17,"e":31.68,"text":"Just a drink and a deck full of alternate lives."},{"s":31.68,"e":36.48,"text":"He said, “That scar? Yeah, I know where you got it."},{"s":36.48,"e":41.84,"text":"That door you never opened? I remember what's beyond it.”"},{"s":41.84,"e":47.21,"text":"I said, “You been watching?” He said, “No, I've been you."},{"s":47.21,"e":52.01,"text":"Every road that you ran, every rain that you knew.”"},{"s":52.01,"e":55.77,"text":"Old soul, cold flow, no need to pretend,"},{"s":55.77,"e":60.47,"text":"Played the beginning so long he could hum the end."},{"s":60.47,"e":65.36,"text":"Galactic gatekeepers? Nah, that's a human-made name."},{"s":65.36,"e":70.82,"text":"Just some ruthless old thinkers who got bored of the game."},{"s":70.82,"e":73.46,"text":"If you've held every answer,"},{"s":73.46,"e":76.09,"text":"If you've walked every road,"},{"s":76.09,"e":78.54,"text":"Why are your hands shaking"},{"s":78.54,"e":81.45,"text":"When the departure board glows?"},{"s":81.45,"e":84.93,"text":"RECKLESS GRAYS! LAST CALL AT THE HUB!"},{"s":84.93,"e":89.64,"text":"Seen my whole life twice and they still showed up."},{"s":89.64,"e":93.21,"text":"NO HALOS! NO HORNS! NO DEBTS TO REPAY!"},{"s":93.21,"e":96.04,"text":"They've been through tomorrow—"},{"s":96.04,"e":98.11,"text":"TILL TOMORROW CHANGED."},{"s":98.11,"e":101.87,"text":"RECKLESS GRAYS! BLACK SUITS IN THE HAZE!"},{"s":101.87,"e":106.57,"text":"Got a billion years behind those unblinking faces."},{"s":106.57,"e":110.81,"text":"Don't tell me the ending; don't take it away."},{"s":110.81,"e":113.63,"text":"They've been through tomorrow—"},{"s":113.63,"e":115.7,"text":"TILL TOMORROW CHANGED."},{"s":115.7,"e":120.12,"text":"Concourse thirteen, clock's running in reverse,"},{"s":120.12,"e":124.45,"text":"A Gray shot pool with the moons of a universe."},{"s":124.45,"e":128.78,"text":"Another one laughed like he knew my next line;"},{"s":128.78,"e":133.76,"text":"Said, “You said it before, in a much worse timeline.”"},{"s":133.76,"e":137.9,"text":"No good guys, bad guys, no gods in disguise,"},{"s":137.9,"e":142.04,"text":"Just impossible minds with impossible lives."},{"s":142.04,"e":146.46,"text":"Some gamble with galaxies, some sit and grieve,"},{"s":146.46,"e":151.07,"text":"Some know when to speak; some know when to leave."},{"s":151.07,"e":155.4,"text":"I said, “Why come back if you've seen it all?”"},{"s":155.4,"e":160.95,"text":"He said, “Same reason you answer when an old friend calls.”"},{"s":160.95,"e":166.22,"text":"“Did you live through the loss?” “Every miserable year.”"},{"s":166.22,"e":171.68,"text":"“Did you feel what I felt?” “Why you think that I'm here?”"},{"s":171.68,"e":176.1,"text":"Not a sermon, not mercy, not some grand design;"},{"s":176.1,"e":181.46,"text":"Just the strangest kind of kinship past the edge of time."},{"s":181.46,"e":184.57,"text":"“Then tell me what happens next.”"},{"s":184.57,"e":185.51,"text":"“I can't.”"},{"s":185.51,"e":188.99,"text":"“You said you already lived my life.”"},{"s":188.99,"e":191.81,"text":"“Every version we could find.”"},{"s":191.81,"e":194.73,"text":"GATE ZERO. DESTINATION UNKNOWN."},{"s":194.73,"e":197.36,"text":"Hallelujah for the question,"},{"s":197.36,"e":199.9,"text":"Not the answer on the wall."},{"s":199.9,"e":202.44,"text":"For the moment no one owns,"},{"s":202.44,"e":204.98,"text":"For the door beyond it all."},{"s":204.98,"e":208.28,"text":"If the stars have seen our stories,"},{"s":208.28,"e":211.19,"text":"If the oldest minds still ache,"},{"s":211.19,"e":214.2,"text":"Then the holiest thing in heaven"},{"s":214.2,"e":217.31,"text":"Might be one choice left to make."},{"s":217.31,"e":221.92,"text":"Every screen blacked out, every Gray stood still,"},{"s":221.92,"e":226.62,"text":"All the engines went quiet on the outside of will."},{"s":226.62,"e":231.23,"text":"Ten trillion old lives and a lifetime of schemes,"},{"s":231.23,"e":236.69,"text":"Not a single one remembered what was coming on the screen."},{"s":236.69,"e":241.21,"text":"I looked at the Gray, said, “So you don't know?”"},{"s":241.21,"e":245.82,"text":"He laughed like a kid at the edge of the unknown."},{"s":245.82,"e":250.71,"text":"First time scared, first time free, first time late,"},{"s":250.71,"e":255.13,"text":"First time the future wouldn't fit inside fate."},{"s":255.13,"e":260.12,"text":"He said, “We crossed every cosmos looking for a sign,"},{"s":260.12,"e":265.95,"text":"But the one thing we couldn't find was a moment not designed.”"},{"s":265.95,"e":270.37,"text":"No throne in the terminal, no savior to praise,"},{"s":270.37,"e":274.51,"text":"Just a room full of veterans finally amazed."},{"s":274.51,"e":278.46,"text":"I said, “What now?” He adjusted his frame:"},{"s":278.46,"e":282.79,"text":"“Live it. For once. Without knowing the game.”"},{"s":282.79,"e":286.27,"text":"RECKLESS GRAYS! LAST CALL AT THE HUB!"},{"s":286.27,"e":290.98,"text":"Seen my whole life twice and they still showed up."},{"s":290.98,"e":294.55,"text":"NO HALOS! NO HORNS! NO DEBTS TO REPAY!"},{"s":294.55,"e":297.37,"text":"They've been through tomorrow—"},{"s":297.37,"e":299.44,"text":"TILL TOMORROW CHANGED."},{"s":299.44,"e":302.93,"text":"RECKLESS GRAYS! ALL EYES ON THE GATE!"},{"s":302.93,"e":307.35,"text":"The oldest souls alive got nothing left to say."},{"s":307.35,"e":311.58,"text":"Don't tell me the ending; don't take it away!"},{"s":311.58,"e":314.4,"text":"For the first time in forever,"},{"s":314.4,"e":316.47,"text":"WE DON'T KNOW THE WAY!"},{"s":316.47,"e":320.24,"text":"Now boarding: the life no one has lived."},{"s":320.24,"e":321.46,"text":"“First time?”"}],"duration":321.96,"source":"estimated","generatedAt":null}